The Gemini software list covers client, server, libraries, and tools.[9] Gemini's founder, Solderpunk, created a client for the protocol called AV-98.[5] Gemini-to-HTTP proxy server [95] gateways such as Mozz.us can be used by web browsers lacking Gemini support.[5][10]
